flowchart TD
    A[Create Draft] --> B[Edit Content and Metadata]
    B --> C{Required Fields Complete?}
    C -- No --> B
    C -- Yes --> D[Submit for Review]
    D --> E[Editorial Review]
    E --> F{Review Decision}
    F -- Changes Requested --> G[Author Updates Content]
    G --> D
    F -- Rejected --> H[Rejected]
    F -- Approved --> I[Approved]
    I --> J{Publish Now or Later?}
    J -- Now --> K[Publish to Channel]
    J -- Later --> L[Create Schedule]
    L --> M[Scheduled Job]
    M --> K
    K --> N{Delivery Result}
    N -- Success --> O[Published]
    N -- Failure --> P[Publication Failed / Retry Queue]
    P --> K
    O --> Q[Version and Audit History]
